  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maji safi salama na Nazava &#x2013; Safe water with Nazava</narrative>
  </title>
  <description akvo:type="4" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scale - Drinking Water</narrative>
  </description>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With this proposal we aim to seize the opportunity of using well-established distribution systems to serve low-income households with access to safe drinking water. It is now time to reach the population off-the water-grid with access to self-supply solutions such as the household water filters from Nazava.
With this proposal we aim to:
Water filters in use in Kenya 79,935
People with improved health in Kenya 311,748
Accumulative Customer savings (US$) $2.2 million
Accumulative CO2 reductions
(ton CO2 equivalent) 82
Accumulative Time saved by women (working years, FTE) 7,319</narrative>
  </description>
